Parallelism 
Host to Device is faster in pinned because it's already allocated
Device to host 

If you move datat from device to host at rate X (10 ms).  Memory pressurse is Y
if you move 10x faster you can reduce memory pressure just by moving data device

With pageable data the OS can always decide to migrate data.  With pinned memory, we avoid the OS and get a direct pointer to the memory.  
Pageable -- GPU has to go through the OS .  With pinned it can do DMA

